; The header -> C package table (design/stage27-build/overview.md §8.3.1 C).
;
; An entry is an advisory requirement for a C header import: `:libs` are plain
; libraries, linked whenever the header is imported; `:pkg-config` applies only
; when no import of the header is annotated, and only if installed.
; $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/nucleus/c-packages.edn extends this table, and its entry for
; a header replaces this one.
;
; `dl` and `pthread` are absent: glibc 2.34+ and musl keep them in libc, and
; there is no unversioned `libdl.so` for `--run` to load.
{"math.h"    {:libs ["m"]}
 "complex.h" {:libs ["m"]}
 "fenv.h"    {:libs ["m"]}
 "tgmath.h"  {:libs ["m"]}
 "zlib.h"    {:pkg-config ["zlib"]}}
